  "conclusion": {
    "state": "proven",
    "proven": [
      "Fresh Retrobution FreeChat uses the exact 440x150 window, 440x113 chat background, three 135x14 tabs, 31x19 quick-message/emote buttons, an active 295x23 text field, a 69x23 SEND control, and an inactive 385x23 field.",
      "Fresh Retrobution MenuChat animates its root to x=40, Emotes to x=72; visible areas use 18 px rows and end fourteen pixels above the screen/chat anchor after the shared 149 px draw offset.",
      "The large-chat emote menu uses the 19 root rows initialized by InitLargeChatEmoteList, exact per-row TutorialAssets/emoteChatIcon textures, five Dance children, three Chill Out children, and six Extras children. Containers always draw the nextArrow style unless selected.",
      "Normal MenuChat adds an ALL line, speech bubble, and echo-confirmed animation. Group and buddy MenuChat add their colored histories/alerts and do not create bubbles or avatar animations.",
      "Movement or jump interrupts an active emote; natural clamp completion returns to idle. Local mounted vehicle rejects standalone emotes with Action_Failure01."
    ],
    "unresolved": [
      "Remote mounted-state suppression cannot be represented until the native client owns a server-authoritative remote vehicle presentation state; the current protocol surface exposes only local PC_VEHICLE_* replies."
    ]
  },
